  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head ia-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ia-connected" id="connected" data-connected hidden role="status"></div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Inbox Assistant</span>
        <h1>Emails drafted in seconds. <em>You check and send.</em></h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--laptop" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/inbox-overload.webp?v=6" alt="" width="1330" height="930" /></figure>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Paste in a client or customer email and it writes the reply in seconds, from your own prices and policies, on a private web page made for your business: open it on your phone or PC, nothing to install. Anything it can&rsquo;t be sure of is marked for a person to fill in. <b>Nothing goes out without someone pressing send.</b></p>
        <ul class="ia-facts" aria-label="At a glance">
          <li><b><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span></b><span>setup: <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit, the rest once it saves 5 hours a week</span></li>
          <li><b><span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span></b><span>a month for the whole business once you keep it, AI usage included</span></li>
          <li><b>3 business days</b><span>at most, to your own page</span></li>
          <li><b>Deposit refunded</b><span>if it doesn&rsquo;t save you 5 hours a week</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="cur-line cur-line--inline"><span class="cur-vat">Prices in <span data-cur-code>ZAR</span>. No VAT is added: we&rsquo;re not VAT-registered.</span> <span class="cur-lbl">Show in</span> <span class="cur-pick" role="group" aria-label="Show prices in"><button type="button" data-cur="ZAR" aria-pressed="true">ZAR</button><button type="button" data-cur="USD" aria-pressed="false">USD</button><button type="button" data-cur="EUR" aria-pressed="false">EUR</button><button type="button" data-cur="GBP" aria-pressed="false">GBP</button></span></p>
        <div class="btn-row page-head__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-inbox-book-top">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" href="#try" data-track="cta-inbox-try"><span data-needs-ai>Try it on one of your emails</span><span data-ai-off>See a sample reply</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="callwhat" aria-label="What happens on the free call"><li>You tell us about the work</li><li>We say honestly if AI fits</li><li>No slides, no pitch</li><li>You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</li></ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- the guarantee and who it's for -->
    <section class="section" id="guarantee" aria-labelledby="guarTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ia-guarantee reveal">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">You pay the rest last</span>
            <h2 id="guarTitle">A R1,500 deposit to start. The rest only once it&rsquo;s saving your team 5 hours a week.</h2>
            <ol class="ia-paylast">
              <li><span><b>After your free call, if it&rsquo;s a fit:</b> you pay a <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit through a secure card payment link, which comes off the setup, and we book a one-hour setup call to time your team&rsquo;s email work and agree how we&rsquo;ll measure it.</span></li>
              <li><span><b>Within 3 business days:</b> your private reply page is live, loaded with your prices and policies.</span></li>
              <li><span><b>Two weeks on real emails, with nothing more to pay.</b> After each reply your team taps how it went.</span></li>
              <li><span><b>Saving 5+ hours a week?</b> You pay the rest of the setup and the monthly plan starts. If not, your deposit is refunded in full within 7 days and we switch it off.</span></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="small">It works with any inbox: you paste an email in and copy the reply out. On Microsoft 365, the drafts can wait right in your inbox instead (up to 15 business days to connect; your page works meanwhile). Want it answering WhatsApp too? That&rsquo;s a <a class="inline-link" href="ai-for-business">custom build</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ia-fit">
            <h3>Who it&rsquo;s for</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><b>20 or more client or customer emails a day</b>: quotes, bookings, orders, &ldquo;where&rsquo;s my&hellip;&rdquo;, &ldquo;which documents do you need?&rdquo;, &ldquo;how do I pay?&rdquo;</li>
              <li><b>New enquiries that wait too long</b>: when the reply is ready in seconds, a new client gets an answer in a minute, not when someone finally has time</li>
              <li><b>Your whole team</b>: everyone uses the same page, whichever mailbox the email came in on. No per-user fees</li>
              <li><b>Any email system</b>: Gmail, Outlook or anything else you can copy an email from</li>
              <li><b>Prices and policies you can share with us</b>, even if they&rsquo;re in a spreadsheet or someone&rsquo;s head</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted">Fewer emails than that? We&rsquo;ll tell you on the call that it probably isn&rsquo;t worth it yet, and suggest something simpler.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- before you hire -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="hire" aria-labelledby="hireTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Before you hire</span>
          <h2 id="hireTitle">Thinking of hiring someone for the inbox? Try this first.</h2>
          <p>It doesn&rsquo;t replace a good person. It takes the typing off the people you have, so they can do the work that needs them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-compare reveal">
          <div class="ia-col">
            <h3>A new admin hire</h3>
            <p class="ia-price">about <span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span> to <span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span> <small>a month</small></p>
            <ul><li>Weeks to recruit and train</li><li>Office hours, leave and sick days</li><li>Still types every reply by hand</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="ia-col ia-col--us">
            <h3>Inbox Assistant</h3>
            <p class="ia-price"><span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span> <small>a month, plus <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup</small></p>
            <ul><li>Ready within 3 business days, only a refundable deposit until it saves 5 hours a week</li><li>A draft in under a minute whenever your team needs one, through the working day</li><li>Your team checks and sends in seconds</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- the timeline: promised at 3 business days, aimed at 1 -->
    <section class="section" id="how" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2 id="howTitle">Ready within 3 business days. About an hour of your time.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps steps--tight reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Day 1: a one-hour setup call</h3><p>We look at your emails together, time how long they take now, and agree the target.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>We set it up</h3><p>Your own private page, loaded with your prices, policies and the way you like to reply.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>You test it</h3><p>Your team tries it on real emails. We fix anything that reads wrong.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Two weeks on real emails, then you decide</h3><p>Paste an email, get the reply, tap how it went. We add up the time saved, and you pay the rest only if it hits the target. If it misses, your deposit comes back.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- try it -->
    <section class="section section--tint aid-sec" id="try" aria-labelledby="tryTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">See it first</span><h2 id="tryTitle"><span data-needs-ai>Paste one of your own customer emails. See the reply it would draft.</span><span data-ai-off>Try a sample email now, or send us one of yours.</span></h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Note</dt><dd>This version doesn&rsquo;t know your prices or dates yet, so it leaves gaps for you to fill. Set up for you, it fills them from your own information. The demo and the Inbox Assistant we set up for you both run on our own AI computer, in South Africa.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <div class="aid try reveal" data-try>
          <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag aid__tag--live" data-needs-ai>Live AI</span><span class="aid__tag" data-ai-off>Sample replies</span><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-sample>Use a sample email</button></div>
          <form class="form try__form" data-try-form novalidate>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label for="tryEmail">A client or customer email</label>
              <textarea id="tryEmail" name="email" rows="7" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Paste an email a customer sent you"></textarea>
              <p class="form__hint">Take out names, phone numbers and account details first. We don&rsquo;t keep what you paste.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label for="tryBiz">What does your business do? <span class="optional">optional</span></label>
              <input id="tryBiz" name="business" type="text" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. Accounting practice in Sandton" />
            </div>
            <div class="try__go"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Draft the reply</button><p class="small muted try__msg" data-try-msg aria-live="polite"></p></div>
          </form>
          <div class="try__out" data-try-out hidden>
            <p class="try__gist"><b>What they want:</b> <span data-try-gist></span></p>
            <div class="try__reply"><h3>The draft reply <small>ready for you</small></h3><div class="try__text" data-try-reply></div></div>
            <div class="try__check" data-try-checkbox><h3>You check before sending</h3><ul data-try-check></ul></div>
            <div class="try__acts"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-copy>Copy the reply</button><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-again>Try another email</button></div>
            <p class="try__next">Want this on every email, with your prices and policies filled in? <a class="inline-link" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-inbox-try-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- founding clients (shown only while the offer runs) -->
    <section class="section founding" id="founding" aria-labelledby="foundTitle" data-founding hidden>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="founding__card">
          <span class="offer-note__tag">Founding clients</span>
          <h2 id="foundTitle">We&rsquo;re new. We&rsquo;d rather prove it than claim it.</h2>
          <p class="founding__lead">Our first <span data-f-total>5</span> clients who keep it get the Inbox Assistant setup <b data-f-offword>free</b>: <b data-f-price>R0</b> instead of <s data-f-was>R9,500</s>.</p>
          <ul class="founding__list">
            <li><b>What you get.</b> The setup <span data-f-offword2>free</span>, even when it works. You pay only the refundable R1,500 deposit, which comes off your first month, until it&rsquo;s saving your team 5 hours a week.</li>
            <li><b>What we ask.</b> We measure before and after, and you let us share the result, with your name or without it. Your choice.</li>
            <li><b>What stays the same.</b> <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span> a month once you keep it, a person checks every reply, and you own your data.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="founding__left"><b data-f-left>5</b> of <span data-f-total2>5</span> places left<span data-f-ends></span>. A place is taken when a client decides to keep it.</p>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-founding-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a></div>
          <p class="tiny muted founding__small">For businesses that qualify (20+ customer emails a day). One place per business, not combined with other discounts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- what's included -->
    <section class="section" id="included" aria-labelledby="inclTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What the monthly fee covers</span>
          <h2 id="inclTitle">One price. Nothing extra to work out.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="ia-incl reveal">
          <li><b>AI usage included</b><span>Up to 1,500 emails a month, shared by your whole team. Busier than that? We agree a higher allowance before anything extra is charged.</span></li>
          <li><b>Kept up to date</b><span>New prices, a new policy, a new service: send it and we update it.</span></li>
          <li><b>Checked every month</b><span>We look at how your team rated each draft (sent as is, edited or rewritten) and tune it wherever replies needed big edits.</span></li>
          <li><b>Time saved, reported</b><span>A short report each month: emails handled and hours given back.</span></li>
          <li><b>A reply by 17:00 the next business day</b><span>WhatsApp or email, from the person who built it. No call centre, no hand-offs.</span></li>
          <li><b>Month to month after 3 months</b><span>The 3 months start once you keep it. After that, stop any time with a month&rsquo;s notice. Your data stays yours.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" id="faq" aria-labelledby="iaFaqTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Questions</span>
          <h2 id="iaFaqTitle">Questions.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Does it send emails by itself?</summary><p>No. It writes the reply on your page; a person checks it, copies it into your email and presses send. Anything it isn&rsquo;t sure of is marked for you to fill in.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What if it gets something wrong?</summary><p>Then the person checking it fixes it before it goes out, and tells us, and we correct it so it doesn&rsquo;t happen again. Each month we also look at which drafts needed big edits and tune those.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Which email does it work with?</summary><p>Any of them: Gmail, Outlook or whatever you use, because you paste the email into your page, live within 3 business days. On Microsoft 365 we can also put the drafts straight into the email thread, with no pasting. That takes up to 15 business days to connect, and you use the page meanwhile. It asks for one permission (read, draft and label mail), never sends or deletes anything, and your IT admin may need to approve it once. It connects the mailbox you sign in with; for a shared inbox, everyone on the team can use the same page.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>How many people can use it?</summary><p>Your whole team. It&rsquo;s one price for the business, not per user, and everyone uses the same private page. The monthly fee covers up to 1,500 emails a month; if you&rsquo;re busier than that, we agree a higher allowance with you before anything extra is charged.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will it sound like us?</summary><p>Yes. We set it up from your own past replies, your tone and your sign-off, and it answers in the language the customer wrote in. It&rsquo;s strongest in English; if many of your customers write in Afrikaans or another language, we check those replies with you during the trial.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>What happens to our data?</summary><p>It&rsquo;s used only to draft your replies, under POPIA. The drafts are written by our own AI computer: an AI model running on a computer we control, in South Africa, so your emails aren&rsquo;t sent to any outside AI company or used to train AI models. On the way, each email passes through our Supabase backend, whose servers are outside South Africa, so that transfer is protected the way POPIA requires, and you can sign our data processing agreement before you start. We don&rsquo;t keep the emails you paste, only a one-line note of what each was about. An email can&rsquo;t make it do anything: it can only write a draft, it can&rsquo;t send, delete or change your prices, and a person checks every reply. Anything legal, tax or medical is marked for a person to check. If you don&rsquo;t keep it, we switch your page off and delete it. <a class="inline-link" href="privacy#security">Security and data, in one screen</a> &middot; <a class="inline-link" href="agreement#dpa">Our DPA</a></p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>When do we pay?</summary><p>A <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit on day one, which comes off the setup. Then your team uses it for two weeks. If it&rsquo;s saving at least 5 hours a week, measured the way we agreed on day one, you pay the rest of the <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup and the <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span> monthly plan starts. If it isn&rsquo;t, your deposit is refunded in full. It needs the access and information we agreed on day one.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Who will we deal with, and what if you&rsquo;re unavailable?</summary><p>We&rsquo;re a small studio: the person on your free call sets up your page and answers your messages, with no account managers or hand-offs. Your prices, policies and instructions are kept as a written document, and if we ever stop working together you get that document and your data. After the first three months it&rsquo;s month to month, so you&rsquo;re never locked in.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>We get fewer than 20 emails a day. Is it worth it?</summary><p>Probably not yet, and we&rsquo;ll say so. A few saved replies or a shared template might do the job. If your volume grows, we can look again.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">See if your inbox qualifies.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call on Google Meet, or we can phone you. Bring 3 to 5 typical customer emails with names removed, and a rough count a day. Need an NDA first? We&rsquo;ll send our mutual NDA to sign.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-inbox-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="callwhat" aria-label="What happens on the free call"><li>You tell us about the work</li><li>We say honestly if AI fits</li><li>No slides, no pitch</li><li>You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</li></ul>
        <p class="cta__alt">Rather we phone you? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-call-open>Pick a time</button> &middot; Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <script src="try-email.js?v=3" defer></script>
